# {{Feature}}: visual changes

Every change a user can see, in the order it landed. The task that makes a visible change adds its
row in the same commit, including changes nobody asked for (a moved button, a new caption, a
spacing fix that reaches other screens). The owner reads this before the walkthrough; a change
missing here is a change the owner finds by accident.

